                    <li class="flex gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg><span>Suitable for machining and manufacturing</span></li>
